      "original_tokenized_text": "'et gruwelkasteel van Antasma\nen Bowser ies verdwenen!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>En alles ies weer très\nbon! Merci beaucoup!<C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": ""
