      "original_text": "Wat afschuwelijk dat we zoiets\nspeciaals kapot moesten maken...<C:0003,0001,>",
      "original_tokenized_text": "Wat afschuwelijk dat we zoiets\nspeciaals kapot moesten maken...<C:0003,0001,>",
      "raw_full_hex": "5700610074002000610066007300630068007500770065006C0069006A006B00200064006100740020007700650020007A006F0069006500740073000A0073007000650063006900610061006C00730020006B00610070006F00740020006D006F0065007300740065006E0020006D0061006B0065006E002E002E002E000E000300010000000000"
    },
    "21": {
      "text": "Wees gerust,\nhoogheid!<C:0003,0001,><C:0000,0004,>De droomsteen kan\nworden hersteld!<C:0003,0001,>",
