      "original_text": "<C:0007,0000,><C:0001,0001,><C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0002,9600>VOELEN JULLIE HEM<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0000,0002,9600>?<C:0000,0002,6400><C:0003,0001,>",
